    narr:narration """The narrative surrounding [decision capture at the point of consensus](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) has evolved from a foundational product thesis established in March 2026 into a series of concrete delivery milestones by August 2026. The core differentiator—capturing artifacts at the moment of agreement—is now supported by the [shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786872563090_1), which marks the transition from conceptual framework to functional implementation. This operational progress is further contextualized by [record-high velocity metrics](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786872563090_2) and the identification of the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786872563090_3) as the primary technical catalyst for this recent throughput. The trajectory reflects a shift from defining the product's value proposition to demonstrating its competence through specific, measurable technical unlocks.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786872563090_1> ;
